  "details": "Exported GameObject, Transform, and UdonBehaviour fields on an UdonBehaviour will always get set to their `self` reference regardless of if they are marked `null` or `this` in the uasm. I am currently working around this by removing the public field from the public field list on the UdonBehaviour if it is null and a GameObject, Transform, or UdonBehaviour. But I am concerned that this behavior may change at some point so it'd be good to have the bug fixed.",
